{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18630","headline":"种柳戏题 · 柳宗元","name":"种柳戏题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柳州柳刺史，种柳柳江边。\n谈笑爲故事，推移成昔年。\n垂阴当覆地，耸干会参天。\n好作思人树，惭无惠化传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18630.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18630","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}